<!--
  FREE personal-team signing (run on your own iPhone, no paid Apple Developer
  account). The prod Runner.entitlements declares associated-domains + App
  Groups, which free signing rejects. This stripped copy has neither.
  Apply with: scripts/ios_personal_signing.sh on   (revert: ... off)
  Universal-link deep links + App Groups won't work in a build using this.
-->
